  "instructions_for_student": "Copy an angle from one location to another using only compass and straightedge. The key idea: an arc and its chord capture the size of an angle. Transfer the arc radius and chord length to a new vertex, and SSS congruence guarantees the copy is exact. In practice mode, try copying different angles."
